cessed in five days.","Your order is being tracked right now.","The parcel was left at the front door.","This product was reviewed by many customers.","Free shipping is offered on all orders."],"grammar":{"title":"Talking About Deliveries — Passive Voice","rules":["A voz passiva usa \"to be\" + particípio passado, focando na ação, não em quem a fez: The package was delivered.","Usada quando o agente da ação é desconhecido ou irrelevante: The item was damaged (não importa quem danificou).","No presente: is/are + V3 (is delivered). No passado: was/were + V3 (was delivered).","Comum em contextos de compras online, notícias e processos."],"table":{"headers":["Estrutura","Uso","Exemplo","Observação"],"rows":[["is/are + V3","passiva no presente","My order is being tracked.","ação em andamento agora"],["was/were + V3","passiva no passado","The package was delivered.","ação concluída no passado"],["will be + V3","passiva no futuro","The refund will be processed.","ação futura"],["by + agent (optional)","quem fez a ação","It was reviewed by many customers.","opcional, usado se relevante"]]}},"quiz":[{"q":"My package ___ delivered yesterday.","a":"was","opts":["was","is","were","be"]},{"q":"The order ___ placed last week.","a":"was","opts":["was","is","were","been"]},{"q":"The item ___ damaged during shipping.","a":"was","opts":["was","is","were","been"]},{"q":"The refund ___ processed in five days.","a":"will be","opts":["will be","was","is being","has been"]},{"q":"Your order ___ tracked right now.","a":"is being","opts":["is being","was","will be","has been"]}],"speak":["My package was delivered yesterday.","The order was placed last week.","The item was damaged during shipping.","The refund will be processed in five days.","Your order is being tracked right now."],"lang":"en"}